---
// Dedicated About Page: Deep-Dive Professional Background, Technical Scope, and Leadership Philosophy
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const pageTitle = "About Robiul Hasan — IT Infrastructure & Systems Engineer";
const pageDescription = "Learn about Robiul Hasan's background in enterprise MSP infrastructure, 2,500+ endpoint management, service desk leadership, and career transition to systems administration and cloud infrastructure.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <Header />

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 lg:py-16 space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 light:text-amber-700 border border-amber-500/20 text-xs font-mono font-medium">
        PROFESSIONAL PROFILE &bull; 5+ YEARS EXPERIENCE
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white light:text-slate-950 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Engineering Reliability Across Enterprise Infrastructure
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        An in-depth look at my background in IT systems support, multi-tenant MSP infrastructure management, service desk co-leadership, and self-hosted automation tooling.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- SECTION 1: CORE BACKGROUND -->
    <section class="space-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 light:border-slate-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-slate-950 tracking-tight">
        Who I Am & Professional Foundation
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p>
          I am an IT infrastructure and support engineer based in Dhaka, Bangladesh, with over 5 years of hands-on experience keeping complex enterprise IT environments reliable, secure, and fully operational.
        </p>
        <p>
          My technical foundation is built on deep practical administration across Microsoft 365, Azure Active Directory / Entra ID, Windows Server, Hyper-V, and modern endpoint management with Microsoft Intune. I approach every system with a reliability-first mindset: ensuring high uptime, strict access controls, prompt incident escalation handling, and seamless disaster recovery readiness.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2: MSP ENVIRONMENT & SERVICE DESK CO-LEADERSHIP -->
    <section class="space-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 light:border-slate-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-slate-950 tracking-tight">
        Multi-Tenant MSP Scale & Service Desk Leadership
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p>
          Currently, I serve as an <strong>L2 Support Engineer & Service Desk Co-Leader at Techants Solutions Pty Ltd</strong>, a premier Managed Service Provider (MSP). In this role, I manage infrastructure and ongoing technical delivery across a diverse portfolio of enterprise client organizations.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 light:bg-white border border-slate-800 light:border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-white light:text-slate-900">2,500+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-amber-400 light:text-amber-600 font-semibold uppercase">Endpoints Under Monthly Maintenance</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600">Patch management, RMM monitoring, system updates, and compliance verification across distributed fleets.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 light:bg-white border border-slate-800 light:border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-white light:text-slate-900">1,100+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-cyan-400 light:text-cyan-600 font-semibold uppercase">Security & Antivirus Assets</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600">Endpoint detection and response (EDR), malware remediation, threat monitoring, and policy enforcement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          As a Service Desk Co-Leader, I co-manage a team of 10+ technical support professionals. I am responsible for training and onboarding L1 staff, evaluating team performance on incident handling, managing Tier-2 escalations, and establishing standardized operating procedures (SOPs). Throughout this operational volume, our team sustains a <strong>customer satisfaction rate (CSAT) consistently above 90%</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3: BCDR & SYSTEMS RELIABILITY -->
    <section class="space-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 light:border-slate-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-slate-950 tracking-tight">
        Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery (BCDR)
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p>
          A core pillar of my day-to-day responsibility is business continuity ownership. I oversee the deployment of Datto disaster recovery and backup agents across client servers and endpoints, verify backup integrity, and generate comprehensive quarterly BCDR audit reports to maintain Service Delivery Operations (SDO) compliance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4: AUTOMATION & AGENTIC AI VISION -->
    <section class="space-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 light:border-slate-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-slate-950 tracking-tight">
        Automation, Scripting & Agentic AI
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p>
          Beyond operational administration, I actively build software and automation to eliminate manual toil. Leveraging Python, Bash scripting, and modern LLM tool-calling APIs, I built and self-host <strong>Hermes</strong>, an autonomous AI assistant capable of executing shell scripts, navigating web portals through headless browsers, and interacting with messaging gateways.
        </p>
        <p>
          I believe the future of enterprise systems administration lies at the intersection of rock-solid cloud infrastructure and intelligent, secure automation workflows.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 5: CAREER TRAJECTORY & GOALS -->
    <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 light:bg-white border border-slate-800 light:border-slate-200 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white light:text-slate-950">
        Career Trajectory & Next Steps
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        I am currently seeking opportunities to transition into dedicated <strong>Systems Administration, Cloud Infrastructure Engineering, and IT Operations Engineering</strong> roles where I can leverage my multi-tenant MSP experience, Microsoft cloud expertise, and automation mindset to scale enterprise systems.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a 
          href="/experience" 
          class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs transition-colors shadow-sm"
        >
          Review Full Experience &rarr;
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/contact" 
          class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 light:bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-700 light:hover:bg-slate-200 text-white light:text-slate-900 text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 light:border-slate-300 transition-colors"
        >
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
